# KPP parameters
# 1DMIX-054 (CONSTRUCTED): all MITgcm defaults, deliberately no non-default
# parameter (see README.md). NOTE: this experiment runs in pressure coordinates
# and pkg/kpp has no pressure-coordinate handling, so every length-like KPP
# quantity (minKPPhbl = drF(1), hbl, zeta, ...) is computed with Pa as if metres.
 &KPP_PARM01
 &
